    <name>MiniNotes</name>

    <summary>Offline-first notes application</summary>

    <description>
        <p>
            MiniNotes is a small offline-first notes application built
            with Qt, QML, C++ and SQLite.
        </p>
        <p>
            Notes are stored locally on the device and remain available
            without an Internet connection.
        </p>
    </description>

